Method Endpoint Description <code>GET</code> <code>/api/tables?dataset={name}</code> List available tables in a BigQuery dataset <code>POST</code> <code>/api/visualize</code> Generate chart from natural language prompt <p>POST <code>/api/visualize</code> request: <pre><code>{
  "prompt": "Show me the city with the most customers",
  "table_name": "customer_data",
  "dataset": "pis"
}
</code></pre></p> <p>Response: <pre><code>{
  "chart_type": "bar",
  "chart_config": { ... },
  "insight": "Jakarta has the highest customer count with 12,340 customers, representing 34% of total.",
  "token_usage": { "input": 1204, "output": 387 }
}
</code></pre></p> <p>Production Deployment</p> <p>Deployed and actively used at PT Porto Indonesia Sejahtera. Backend running on Cloud Run, frontend on Firebase Hosting, with live data from the BigQuery data warehouse built with the CDC pipeline.</p>
